/* ---------- CJHQ partner organizations ----------
   Built from PARTNERS_DATA, the list CJHQ actually publishes. It is NOT a
   second database: the names and websites are read from the same array the
   partner marquee renders, so adding a partner to the site adds it here.

   WHAT THIS DATA ACTUALLY CONTAINS, which matters more than what we might wish
   it contained: a name, a logo and - for 14 of the 16 - a website. There are no
   phone numbers, no emergency numbers, no emails, no descriptions, no service
   categories, and the Firestore `partners` collection carries the same three
   fields. So this handler can name an organization and hand over its official
   site, and it will say plainly that CJHQ holds no verified phone number rather
   than reaching for one from anywhere else. A wrong number for Hatzolah or
   Chaverim is the single most damaging thing this assistant could produce.

   The aliases below are spelling and abbreviation variants of names already in
   the list. No organization, service or contact detail is invented here. */
